{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17764","headline":"和令狐舍人酬峰上人题山栏孤竹 · 杨巨源","name":"和令狐舍人酬峰上人题山栏孤竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满院冰姿粉箨残，一茎青翠近帘端。\n离丛自欲亲香火，抱节何妨共岁寒。\n能让繁声任真籁，解将孤影对芳兰。\n范云许访西林寺，枝叶须和彩凤看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}